WEBVTT

00:00:00.453 --> 00:00:01.206
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>Anna</b>

00:00:02.704 --> 00:00:05.753
<v><b>Anna:</b></v> My favourite meal of the day is dinner.

00:00:06.586 --> 00:00:11.510
I usually have dinner at home, but sometimes at a restaurant.

00:00:12.403 --> 00:00:16.231
I usually have meat or fish and vegetables,

00:00:16.784 --> 00:00:20.291
and if I’m at a restaurant I have a glass of wine.